@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false

actor "业主" as Owner
participant "RenewUI" as UI
participant "PetManager" as Ctrl
participant "PetLib" as Lib
participant "Reviewer" as Reviewer
participant "消息平台" as MSG

MSG -> Owner : 年审提醒消息（到期前30天）
Owner -> UI : 进入年审入口\n更新疫苗有效期+上传新材料
UI -> Ctrl : submitRenewal(petId, newVaccine, materials)
Ctrl -> Ctrl : 校验材料完整性 <<include>>
Ctrl -> Lib : createRenewApplication(petId, newVaccine, materials)
Lib --> Ctrl : "年审审核中"状态
Ctrl --> UI : 提交成功
UI --> Owner : 显示年审申请已提交

Reviewer -> UI : 审核通过
UI -> Ctrl : approveRenewal(appId)
Ctrl -> Lib : extendCertificate(petId, 顺延365天)
Lib --> Ctrl : 成功
@enduml